; Pass counter: frames of the game loop, modulo 256
;
; Incremented once at the end of every pass of the frame loop (#R$89AD, $8A49).
; Each time it wraps from $FF to 0 the clock advances by one minute (#R$857F),
; so a game minute is 256 passes (about 19 seconds with the tune on and 17
; with it off, see #R$89AD). The low bits also drive animations: the colour of
; the flashing items (#R$93D1), the guard figure in the Master Bedroom
; (#R$9534) and the toilet (#R$959A). Cleared by #R$87CA at a new game and by
; #R$9584 when the ending stage 3 starts (so the toilet animation starts in
; step).
; .
; Observed: the clock changes from 7:00am to 7:01am 256 passes after the counter
; was 0, and with the counter poked to $FF the minute advances in the next pass.
@label=PassCounter
g$85CB DEFB $00
